<%- include('../partials/head', { bodyClass: 'page-marketing page-shipping' }) %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<div class="container mkt-prose">
  <h1 class="page-title">Shipping &amp; Returns</h1>

  <h2>Shipping</h2>
  <table class="info-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Method</th><th>Time</th><th>Cost</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Standard (Canada &amp; US)</td><td>2&ndash;7 business days</td><td>$9.95 CAD &mdash; <strong>free over $100 CAD</strong></td></tr>
      <tr><td>Express</td><td>1&ndash;3 business days</td><td>$14.95 CAD</td></tr>
      <tr><td>In-Store Pickup</td><td>Ready in 2 hours</td><td>Free</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>Orders ship from our distribution centre in Mississauga, ON. Orders placed before 12pm ET ship the same business day. US orders are shipped DDP &mdash; duties and brokerage are on us.</p>

  <h2>Returns</h2>
  <p>30 days, any store or by mail, free either way. Items must be unworn with tags attached. Refunds go back to the original payment method within 3&ndash;5 business days of us receiving the return.</p>
  <p>Final sale: face coverings, undergarments, and anything marked "final sale" at checkout. Clearance items can be returned by mail but not in store (long story, ask a store manager).</p>

  <h2>Currency</h2>
  <p>Prices can be displayed in CAD or USD using the selector in the top bar. All orders are charged in Canadian dollars; USD pricing is an estimate based on a daily rate.</p>

  <div class="mkt-cta-band">
    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
